{"id":"local","lemma":"local","pos":"adj","rank":2668,"glosses":["local"],"ipa":"/lɔ.kal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/Fr-local.ogg/Fr-local.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"locale","masculinePlural":"locaux","femininePlural":"locales"},"formAudio":{"locale":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-locale.wav","locaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-locaux.wav","locales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-locales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La bière locale est excellente.","en":"The local brew is excellent.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"beer"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"excellent","l":"excellent"}]},{"text":"Elle travaille comme infirmière dans l'hôpital local.","en":"She works as a nurse in the local hospital.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"nurse"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"hospital"},null]},{"text":"Nos enfants vont tous à l'école locale.","en":"Our children all go to the local school.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"notre"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"school"},null]},{"text":"Il fut transporté vers un hôpital local.","en":"He was transported to a local hospital.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"to transport","l":"transporter"},{"g":"towards"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hospital"},null]},{"text":"C'est une coutume locale.","en":"This is a local custom.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"custom"},null]}]}